<title>CROATIA: SOCCER-CROATIA DRAW 1-1 WITH DENMARK.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIA DRAW 1-1 WITH DENMARK.</headline>
<dateline>SPLIT, Croatia 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia and Denmark drew</p>
<p>1-1 (halftime 0-0) in their World Cup group one qualifying match</p>
<p>on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Croatia: Davor Suker 50.</p>
<p>Denmark: Brian Laudrup 82,</p>
<p>Attendance - 34,000.</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p> Greece		 4   2   1   1   7   3   7</p>
<p> Denmark		3   2   1   0   5   2   7</p>
<p> Croatia		3   1   2   0   6   3   5</p>
<p> Bosnia		 3   1   0   2   3   8   3</p>
<p> Slovenia	     3   0   0   3   1   6   0</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Croatia - 1-Drazen Ladic; 23-Niko Kovac, 3-Robert Jarni,</p>
<p>14-Zvonimir Soldo, 5-Nikola Jerkan, 6-Slaven Bilic, 7-Aljosa</p>
<p>Asanovic (16-Nenad Pralija - 84), 8-Robert Prosinecki, 9-Davor</p>
<p>Suker, 10-Zvonimir Boban, 11-Alen Boksic (19-Goran Vlaovic -</p>
<p>75).</p>
<p>Denmark- 1-Peter Schmeichel; 2-Jacob Laursen, 3-Marc Rieper,</p>
<p>4-Jes Hoegh (13-Michael Sjonberg - 14), 5-Jan Heintze, 6-Thomas</p>
<p>Helveg, 7-Per Frandsen (15-Jon Dahl Tomasson - 70), 8-Claus</p>
<p>Thomsen, 9-Alen Nielsen 10-Mikkel Beck (18-Per Pedersen - 57),</p>
<p>11-Brian Laudrup.</p>
<p>Remaining matches:</p>
<p> April 2   -   Croatia v Slovenia</p>
<p> April 2   -   Bosnia v Greece</p>
<p> April 30  -   Denmark v Slovenia</p>
<p> April 30  -   Greece v Croatia</p>
<p> June 8    -   Denmark v Bosnia</p>
<p> Aug 20    -   Bosnia v Denmark</p>
<p> Sept 6    -   Croatia v Bosnia</p>
<p> Sept 6    -   Slovenia v Greece</p>
<p> Sept 10   -   Denmark v Croatia</p>
<p> Sept 10   -   Bosnia v Slovenia</p>
<p> Oct 11    -   Greece v Denmark</p>
<p> Oct 11    -   Slovenia v Croatia</p>
</text>
